+### tool_mobile
+
+#### Added
+
+- A new admin setting `tool_mobile/showlogoinappheader` has been added under Mobile Premium features. The `tool_mobile_get_config` external function now returns the `tool_mobile_showlogoinappheader` setting, which the app uses to decide whether to display the site logo instead of the site name in the Site home and Dashboard header.
+
+  For more information see [MDL-88867](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-88867)
+
